{"_id":"6962b39153b2145f8912b128","title":"Private Watchdog","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/340b39377c03f9688511832951f10152af716c309004b1c4fe092f46f36565b4.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1768076177474.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/340b39377c03f9688511832951f10152af716c309004b1c4fe092f46f36565b4.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1768076177474.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Private-Watchdog-83903","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":603,"executes":103,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/fa774f547803b7c7385cfcf9a73d67abf4904cd9f569c1bb9f1278310a0affab.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1768076177474.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1768076177474.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/fa774f547803b7c7385cfcf9a73d67abf4904cd9f569c1bb9f1278310a0affab.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1768076177474.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1768076177474.png"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-01-10T20:16:17.491Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-10T20:16:17.491Z","lastBump":"2026-01-10T20:16:17.491Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Gorinch/Roblox-Private-Watchdog/refs/heads/main/Script.lua\"))()","features":"This script is designed for users who stay idle on servers (primarily private ones) and want to be notified when someone else joins. It prevents the standard 20-minute idle kick and provides visual and audio alerts when you are no longer alone.\n\nMain Features:\nAnti-AFK (VirtualUser): Emulates user input to prevent being kicked for inactivity.\n\nPlayer Detection: Displays a large screen notification and plays an alert sound when a player joins the server.\n\nSelective Alert: If launched on a server with multiple players, you can choose Friends-Only mode. In this mode, the alert will only trigger specifically when a friend joins the server.\n\nIf you are alone on the server, the protection starts automatically.\nIf other players are already present, a menu will appear allowing you to select the operation mode. It is RECOMMENDED to enable Friends-Only mode in this situation to avoid immediate alerts from random players.","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69428bc09aa5db97af1bd0cd","username":"Gorynych_","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c9d8dd2bb4be11af8b2ce675aa3d5ac352cafff7ad231c5241a359c6d01fb184.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69428bc09aa5db97af1bd0cd-1765968954920.png"},"status":"offline","id":"69428bc09aa5db97af1bd0cd","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c9d8dd2bb4be11af8b2ce675aa3d5ac352cafff7ad231c5241a359c6d01fb184.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69428bc09aa5db97af1bd0cd-1765968954920.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T22:21:26.199Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6962b39153b2145f8912b12b","editBy":{"_id":"69428bc09aa5db97af1bd0cd","username":"Gorynych_","status":"offline","id":"69428bc09aa5db97af1bd0cd"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-01-10T20:16:17.495Z"}],"comments":[]}